// Pillar 5 Step 4, M14 irrigation: Imani O'Neill (she/her, gardener, dry humour, cheerful) on the rota. Seat E2.
title: The racks
from: Imani O'Neill
gist: Imani showed you the garden's irrigation: clear the nozzles on each rack so the water runs even.
== lines
oneill-imani: Works! Excellent. The racks have been sulking.   [gesture]
oneill-imani > you: Nozzles clog. Roots get greedy. Clear each one and watch the spray.
oneill-imani: Even spray, happy lettuce. Uneven spray, sad lettuce. Nobody wants sad lettuce.   [laugh]
